Firmware formats
----------------
The ELE3 container, the SysEx transport and the packing format were first
documented by elektron-firmware-tool
(https://github.com/mischa85/elektron-firmware-tool, MIT, (c) 2026 Marcel
Bierling). No code from that tool is included; it served as a
cross-check.

Elektron
--------
Elektron, Digitakt, Digitone, Syntakt and Analog are trademarks of Elektron
Music Machines. elekloader is not affiliated with or endorsed by Elektron.
It contains no Elektron firmware and distributes nothing derived from it:
every build happens on the user's machine, from the stock OS file the user
supplies. Mods carry only their authors' own bytes, plus hashes of the stock
bytes they expect.
